OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fspecially recorded performances,
OL,8,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,9,     FHay-on-Wye festival and a concerto
OL,10,     Ffor the fifth regular wind quintet
OL,11,     Fmember, the horn.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald explores the theories
OL,14,     Faround Purcell's death at the age
OL,15,     Fof just 36, and examines the
OL,16,     Fvarious tributes made to the
OL,17,     Fcomposer after his passing.
